\import{macros}
\meta{agent-authored}{true}

\taxon{Definition}
\title{Update proposal}
\tag{ftip}
\tag{optimization}

\p{Given a current parameter--optimizer state #{(\theta_n,z_n)}, selected
records, their attempt annotations, and credit targets, an
\strong{update proposal} is a candidate next state}

##{(\widetilde\theta_{n+1},\widetilde z_{n+1},
\delta_n^{\rm diag}).}

\p{The diagnostic record #{\delta_n^{\rm diag}} contains the quantities
required by the declared acceptance rule. It is distinct from the
accept--reject decision #{d_n} recorded for the proposal. Constructing the proposal
incurs update cost even if the proposal is later rejected.}
